## Basic webhook security note (per Day 10 "Learn" objectives)
For production use, add one of:
- **Secret path**: make the path itself hard to guess (e.g. `/form-submission-8f3ac21`), or
- **Header check**: add an IF node right after the Webhook node checking `{{$json.headers['x-api-key']}} === "your-secret"`, rejecting with a 401 Respond node if it doesn't match.

This workflow currently relies on path obscurity only — for a graded submission, mentioning this as a "next improvement" is a good note to add to your report.
